00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:05.500
<b>I'm so glad you're all right.</b>

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:06.230
<b>Thanks.</b>

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>I'm grateful for everyone's help.</b>

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:13.910
<b>Though it's a bit annoying that
<i>Ludmila</i> of all people saved the day.</b>

00:00:13.910 --> 00:00:14.740
<b>Anyway,</b>

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:19.990
<b>Tigre went to quite some lengths to save you. It was a sight to see.</b>

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:23.370
<b>W-Well...</b>

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:25.070
<b>But I...</b>

00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:27.840
<b>I just stood there, too stunned to move.</b>

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:29.710
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.130
<b>Lady Eleonora...</b>

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:35.970
<b>That's why I've decided to treat Tigre to a reward.</b>

