00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:36.150
<b>Um, please put on some clothes.</b>

00:02:36.630 --> 00:02:38.300
<b>Aren't you embarrassed?</b>

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:42.050
<b>Who'd get embarrassed about being seen naked by a lowly animal?</b>

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:44.930
<b>Given that you're still standing there,</b>

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:48.560
<b>it's fairly obvious you didn't plan on assaulting me, or did you?</b>

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:49.640
<b>No, this was an accident.</b>

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:54.150
<b>I'm to blame for assuming the bath would be completely empty.</b>

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:57.150
<b>Is that all you've got to say?</b>

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:00.910
<b>I'm terribly sorry.</b>

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:11.460
<b>How was your bath?</b>

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:14.670
<b>Don't tell me you...</b>

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.460
<b>Hm? Me?</b>

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:33.810
<b>What's wrong?</b>

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:38.570
<b>Lady Ludmila of the proud House Lourie won't deign to eat gruel from a street stall?</b>

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:40.150
<b>Of course not.</b>

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:41.920
<b>I couldn't care less.</b>

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:44.120
<b>A <i>proper</i> war maiden won't eat at street stalls—</b>

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:46.330
<b>Hear, hear!</b>

00:03:49.750 --> 00:03:51.500
<b>This looks great!</b>

00:03:57.140 --> 00:03:58.670
<b>How childish.</b>

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:58.680
<b>Absolutely awesome!</b>

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:01.420
<b>Mm, delicious!</b>

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:04.180
<b>It's so creamy!</b>

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:08.560
<b>Why don't you try some too?</b>

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:12.390
<b>It's my way of making up for earlier.</b>

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:14.480
<b>What, with this?</b>

00:04:15.140 --> 00:04:18.020
<b>Well, I suppose it's the thought that counts.</b>

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:20.610
<b>I can guess who's <i>really</i> at fault anyway.</b>

00:04:25.600 --> 00:04:27.410
<b>Surprisingly good!</b>

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:28.830
<b>Glad to hear it.</b>

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:31.790
<b>Hey! What're you doing?!</b>

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:33.460
<b>That's my line.</b>

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:37.460
<b>You shouldn't waste a moment of your time on <i>that</i> girl.</b>

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:40.170
<b>I only shared my food with her!</b>

00:04:37.880 --> 00:04:40.170
<b>Lover's quarrel! Lover's quarrel!</b>

00:04:45.300 --> 00:04:46.760
<b>Sir Tigrevurmud...</b>

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:50.010
<b>You're a kind man.</b>

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:51.970
<b>But that's all you are.</b>

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:55.480
<b>You're completely under Eleonora's thumb.</b>

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:56.650
<b>I've lost interest in you.</b>

00:04:56.650 --> 00:04:58.860
<b>That's what you think of him?</b>

00:04:58.860 --> 00:04:59.730
<b>What a joke.</b>

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:02.990
<b>Let me paraphrase you:</b>

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:08.700
<b>"I can't even recognize how
great a man Tigre actually is."</b>

00:05:10.910 --> 00:05:12.290
<b>Pitiful.</b>

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:17.250
<b>Lim!</b>

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:19.460
<b>Once you get back to Leitmeritz,</b>

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:21.550
<b>strengthen our border patrols.</b>

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:23.170
<b>You don't think Lady Ludmila...?</b>

00:05:26.630 --> 00:05:28.430
<b>Just as Elen predicted,</b>

00:05:28.430 --> 00:05:32.930
<b>Ludmila assembled an army on Leitmeritz's border.</b>

00:05:33.780 --> 00:05:38.060
<b>As a result Elen ended up being sandwiched</b>

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:41.150
<b>between the forces of Duke Thenardier and Ludmila.</b>

00:05:42.230 --> 00:05:46.150
<b>From the start, Thenardier's intention had been to restrict Elen's movements</b>

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:51.700
<b>by having the war maiden Ludmila keep her in check.</b>

00:05:53.380 --> 00:05:55.040
<b>Unlike his stupid son,</b>

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:58.120
<b>Duke Thenardier is pretty clever.</b>

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:59.710
<b>Will you fight Ludmila?</b>

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.210
<b>She might be keener on it than you think.</b>

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:03.340
<b>You don't mean...?</b>

00:06:03.340 --> 00:06:07.380
<b>Lady Ludmila has nothing to gain from attacking us.</b>

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:12.060
<b>Being in Thenardier's good books improves the situation for her principality, Olmütz.</b>

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:15.890
<b>Tigre, I'll let you decide.</b>

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:17.230
<b>Me?</b>

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:20.400
<b>Fighting her now means we'll no longer have to worry about her.</b>

00:06:20.940 --> 00:06:22.820
<b>Or we could send troops to Alsace</b>

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:25.230
<b>to prepare against invasions
from Thenardier and Ganelon.</b>

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:26.820
<b>It's your decision.</b>

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:34.700
<b>Yeah, you're right.</b>

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:37.460
<b>This is my fight, as well.</b>

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:38.870
<b>Of course.</b>

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:42.960
<b>We also have to think about 
Viscount Augre's safety now that we're allies.</b>

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:44.840
<b>Let's send an envoy to Ludmila.</b>

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:50.760
<b>Ludmila ignored the envoy dispatched by Tigre.</b>

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:53.600
<b>Leitmeritz's troops now advance,</b>

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:57.220
<b>while the forces of Olmütz ready for battle.</b>

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:09.700
<b>Eleonora is heading our way.</b>

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:12.200
<b>She's marching to her doom.</b>

00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:15.950
<b>Are we really going to fight the 
Wind Princess of the Silver Flash?</b>

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:21.210
<b>House Lourie and House Thenardier have been allies for about eighty years now.</b>

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:24.590
<b>That alliance won't be dissolved on my watch.</b>

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:28.550
<b>I have inherited the pride of generations past along with my Lavias.</b>

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:30.800
<b>Quite unlike Eleonora.</b>

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:35.350
<b>West of the towering Tatra Mountains</b>

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:37.310
<b>lie the Blycolin Plains.</b>

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:41.520
<b>Amid the frigid air and the fluttering snow</b>

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:43.850
<b>the first round of battle was about to begin.</b>

00:08:12.030 --> 00:08:13.520
<b>Nicely done.</b>

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:15.090
<b>They're pretty tough...</b>

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:20.260
<b>The day ended with neither side being able to achieve victory.</b>

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:25.530
<b>Both armies, having suffered heavy casualties, drew back.</b>

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:33.650
<b>What do you think of her soldiers?</b>

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:37.200
<b>No matter how many you kill, there's no opening.</b>

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:38.160
<b>You're right.</b>

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:41.200
<b>She's always had a solid defense.</b>

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:43.540
<b>Probably the strongest among all war maidens.</b>

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:47.080
<b>It doesn't seem to fit in with her aggressive character.</b>

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:50.460
<b>I don't see Lady Ludmila
fighting at the front too often.</b>

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:55.200
<b>I'm glad she didn't.</b>

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:58.100
<b>Hey, I could take her easily on the field.</b>

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:02.600
<b>Tomorrow I'll personally lead our forces and crush her.</b>

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:04.390
<b>Lady Eleonora,</b>

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:07.610
<b>how did your previous fights
against Lady Ludmila turn out?</b>

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:09.360
<b>Two victories, one loss.</b>

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:13.030
<b>When I asked Lady Ludmila in the past, she claimed to have the same score.</b>

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:14.900
<b>Come again?</b>

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:17.280
<b>The way I see it, there was a draw.</b>

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:21.370
<b>But both of them insist that it was their victory.</b>

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:23.870
<b>You two really can't stand each other, huh?</b>

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:27.290
<b>There's a tradition of Leitmeritz and Olmütz being at odds.</b>

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:29.040
<b>Tradition?</b>

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:31.550
<b>There've been hostilities from war maidens of House Lourie,</b>

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:34.550
<b>including Ludmila's mother and grandmother, for generations.</b>

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:36.340
<b>Her mother and grandmother?</b>

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:38.050
<b>She inherited her rank?</b>

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:39.640
<b>Nope.</b>

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:41.140
<b>War maidens are always</b>

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:43.060
<b>chosen by their Dragon Gear.</b>

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:52.440
<b>Well, we can talk about the details later.</b>

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:55.320
<b>Right now we should get ready for battle.</b>

00:09:56.900 --> 00:10:00.070
<b>The Olmütz forces have withdrawn completely.</b>

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:02.740
<b>It seems they have holed up in the Tatra Mountains.</b>

00:10:02.740 --> 00:10:04.160
<b>They've got us good!</b>

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:08.620
<b>Are you suggesting that's been Ludmila's plan all along?</b>

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:12.420
<b>They must've used yesterday's battle to sound us out.</b>

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:17.970
<b>Only one path leads to the citadel overlooking the Tatra Mountains.</b>

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:21.300
<b>The incline leading up to it is
littered with defensive positions,</b>

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:23.430
<b>making an enemy approach exceedingly difficult.</b>

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:29.480
<b>She seems dead set on a siege.</b>

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:33.980
<b>Using her Lavias, Ludmila reinforced
the gate's structural weaknesses with ice,</b>

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:35.570
<b>making it far tougher than normal.</b>

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:40.570
<b>From what I heard, my ancestors had a hell of a time trying to crack that nut.</b>

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:43.580
<b>But I'll win this fight, no matter what!</b>

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:56.960
<b>The Leitmeritz army charged over and over again,</b>

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:59.590
<b>but gained no ground.</b>

00:10:59.590 --> 00:11:04.140
<b>Soon the battle had come to a complete standstill.</b>

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:07.530
<b>You cannot!</b>

00:11:07.530 --> 00:11:09.230
<b>I told you so yesterday, didn't I?!</b>

00:11:09.570 --> 00:11:12.350
<b>But if we continue like this,
the battle will drag on endlessly.</b>

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:14.230
<b>The cold's already taking a toll on our men!</b>

00:11:14.720 --> 00:11:16.780
<b>I'll use Arifar's power to fly,</b>

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:19.650
<b>swing around their camp, 
and wipe them all out from behind!</b>

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:21.710
<b>Sir Tigrevurmud, please stop her!</b>

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:23.030
<b>It's too reckless!</b>

00:11:24.020 --> 00:11:24.910
<b>Tigre,</b>

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:26.990
<b>who's your owner?</b>

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:29.250
<b>I belong to you.</b>

00:11:29.550 --> 00:11:30.790
<b>Yes, you do.</b>

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:35.670
<b>That's why you should trust me, 
obey me, and see me off with a smile.</b>

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:36.500
<b>Right?</b>

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:42.500
<b>You...</b>

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:46.260
<b>You're very important to me.</b>

00:11:48.470 --> 00:11:51.520
<b>I know that bringing you out here, 
onto the battlefield,</b>

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:53.650
<b>was asking for a lot.</b>

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:57.570
<b>But your plan is too reckless. 
I don't want you to do something that dangerous.</b>

00:11:57.570 --> 00:11:58.780
<b>Really?</b>

00:11:58.780 --> 00:11:59.280
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:03.030
<b>You actually consider me important to you?</b>

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:04.820
<b>Yes, I do.</b>

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:05.870
<b>Nothing tops me?</b>

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:10.290
<b>What were you thinking of just now?</b>

00:12:11.790 --> 00:12:12.710
<b>Alsace.</b>

00:12:17.590 --> 00:12:20.550
<b>You sure love your homeland, don't you?</b>

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:21.300
<b>Well, that's okay.</b>

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:25.050
<b>Both you and Alsace belong to me, after all.</b>

00:12:25.360 --> 00:12:26.930
<b>Yeah, true enough.</b>

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:30.360
<b>By the way, if you'd mentioned some other woman instead,</b>

00:12:30.360 --> 00:12:34.440
<b>I'd have lopped off your head in an instant.</b>

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:37.520
<b>You were saved by your own wit.</b>

00:12:37.520 --> 00:12:38.270
<b>Good job.</b>

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:42.490
<b>So, will you give up on your plan?</b>

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:45.700
<b>If you have a better idea, I'm all ears.</b>

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:49.080
<b>You know, about that...</b>

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:50.950
<b>Could you do me a favor?</b>

