00:13:24.100 --> 00:13:25.670
<b><i>It's been three days...</i></b>

00:13:27.760 --> 00:13:28.580
<b>Here.</b>

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:30.200
<b>A bear skin?</b>

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:35.710
<b>I once heard a story about a village
where the hunters wore animal hides.</b>

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:38.100
<b>This will keep you from drawing suspicion.</b>

00:13:39.190 --> 00:13:40.810
<b>H-Hey...</b>

00:13:45.350 --> 00:13:46.060
<b>Cute.</b>

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:47.560
<b>Huh?</b>

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:49.940
<b>I didn't say anything.</b>

00:13:50.560 --> 00:13:52.850
<b>Are you sure you'll be okay?</b>

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:54.930
<b>I'll be fine.</b>

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:58.730
<b>I'll find a way to the peak. Count on it.</b>

00:14:01.730 --> 00:14:03.150
<b>I still have some water left.</b>

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:05.240
<b>But no food...</b>

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:33.390
<b>Did you shoot that arrow?</b>

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:40.600
<b>Um, aren't you cold?</b>

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:43.570
<b>I'm a bit special in that regard. Don't worry about it.</b>

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:46.820
<b>The fox has been dead for a while now.</b>

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:49.150
<b>Where did you shoot him from?</b>

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:56.750
<b>Don't lie to me, commoner.</b>

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:58.790
<b>You can't hit from that far.</b>

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:12.870
<b>I'm sorry. I shouldn't have doubted you.</b>

00:15:18.310 --> 00:15:20.140
<b><i>Maybe she isn't as stubborn as I thought.</i></b>

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:25.110
<b>Why don't you take off that pelt?</b>

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:27.940
<b>As long as I'm around,</b>

00:15:27.940 --> 00:15:31.450
<b>neither the cold of the wind nor the snow should bother you.</b>

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:34.120
<b>The laws of my village</b>

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:38.120
<b>forbid taking off the hides while we're up in the mountains.</b>

00:15:38.410 --> 00:15:40.330
<b>Oh. That's a shame.</b>

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:41.620
<b>What's your name?</b>

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:43.700
<b>Urs.</b>

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:46.380
<b>Are you a war maiden?</b>

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:48.920
<b>Yes, I am.</b>

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:51.260
<b>Not the slightest reaction, huh?</b>

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:53.090
<b>Well, that's okay.</b>

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:55.300
<b>Given how talented you are,</b>

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:57.220
<b>I can forgive your lack of manners.</b>

00:15:58.520 --> 00:15:59.850
<b>I have an idea:</b>

00:15:59.850 --> 00:16:02.120
<b>Come and serve me, Urs.</b>

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:07.020
<b>Your skill with the bow makes you more than worthy of joining my army.</b>

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:11.110
<b>I traveled here from a faraway place.</b>

00:16:11.110 --> 00:16:14.030
<b>And eventually I will return to the land of my birth.</b>

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:17.280
<b>Oh. That's too bad.</b>

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:20.620
<b>Don't you worry about me being a spy?</b>

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:22.710
<b>That's a funny thing to say.</b>

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:24.210
<b>Relax.</b>

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:27.040
<b>I can see an outstanding hunter easily making it out this far.</b>

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:29.720
<b>But an army never could.</b>

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:33.050
<b>I know!</b>

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:57.960
<b>Here, drink this.</b>

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:04.830
<b>It's good.</b>

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:06.750
<b>Glad to hear it!</b>

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:08.380
<b>Tea is great, isn't it?</b>

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:10.460
<b>It warms both body and soul.</b>

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:13.970
<b><i>I never would've guessed I'd see her smile like that.</i></b>

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:19.260
<b>What's the matter, Urs?</b>

00:17:20.510 --> 00:17:21.270
<b>Well?</b>

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:22.640
<b>Nothing.</b>

00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:25.190
<b>Why would a war maiden venture out alone?</b>

00:17:25.940 --> 00:17:27.270
<b>To have some fun.</b>

00:17:27.850 --> 00:17:31.020
<b>Yes, I simply wanted to have some fun.</b>

00:17:31.020 --> 00:17:34.280
<b>If you feel like it, you can tell me your story. I'll listen.</b>

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:37.070
<b>Get it off your chest.</b>

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:41.870
<b>Simply imagine you're venting into 
a tree hollow, like they did in that old fable.</b>

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:46.210
<b>You know, you're the nicest bear I've ever met.</b>

00:17:49.290 --> 00:17:51.500
<b>When I was chosen to be a war maiden,</b>

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:54.550
<b>I felt ready for the honor and
responsibility that came with it.</b>

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:55.260
<b>But...</b>

00:17:55.920 --> 00:18:00.220
<b>I had to work with people I hated for the good of the country.</b>

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:05.270
<b>To uphold my family's reputation, I had to hide my own feelings.</b>

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:09.770
<b>I thought I... knew what this meant, but...</b>

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:17.490
<b>Urs, I'll be sure to remember your name!</b>

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:21.990
<b>If you feel like it, come visit my palace in Olmütz anytime!</b>

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:30.500
<b>I'm in trouble.</b>

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:33.690
<b>Once the sun sets,</b>

00:18:34.500 --> 00:18:37.660
<b>I'll no longer be able to follow Ludmila's tracks.</b>

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:48.480
<b>Found it.</b>

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:53.520
<b>A route... to the citadel.</b>

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:04.490
<b>Hang in there! It's not far ahead!</b>

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:07.660
<b>The rear is lightly guarded.</b>

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:10.370
<b>A hundred of us will be more than enough to...</b>

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:16.250
<b>That comes unexpected.</b>

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:19.630
<b>Perhaps meeting you made
Ludmila take extra precautions.</b>

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:21.800
<b>What do we do? Turn back?</b>

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:22.510
<b>No.</b>

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:25.560
<b>If we give up now, we play right into the enemy's hands.</b>

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:27.810
<b>We're wasting time here.</b>

00:19:27.810 --> 00:19:30.190
<b>Thenardier could already be closing in on Alsace.</b>

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:34.060
<b>I'm going to blow away that gate.</b>

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:47.950
<b>Elen!</b>

00:19:50.270 --> 00:19:52.960
<b>Dragon who brings victory, be with us!</b>

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:01.840
<b>Ley Admos!</b>

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:19.230
<b>Elen!</b>

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:28.200
<b>What're you doing, Tigre?!</b>

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:29.580
<b>The gate can't take another hit!</b>

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:32.910
<b>Those arrows would've hit <i>you</i> long before that!</b>

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:36.840
<b>There's no other way!</b>

00:20:36.840 --> 00:20:38.380
<b>You know that, don't you?!</b>

00:20:39.130 --> 00:20:40.050
<b>Forget it.</b>

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:42.300
<b>They already know we're here.</b>

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:45.090
<b>Time's running out!</b>

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:48.220
<b>For both you... and Alsace!</b>

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:49.430
<b>Elen...</b>

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:52.600
<b><i>There's got to be something we can do! Anything...</i></b>

00:20:54.640 --> 00:20:55.650
<b>Arifar!</b>

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:56.940
<b>Huh?</b>

00:20:56.940 --> 00:20:57.940
<b>Please,</b>

00:20:57.940 --> 00:20:59.820
<b>lend me your strength!</b>

00:21:00.480 --> 00:21:03.070
<b>I know that Elen is your master.</b>

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:05.820
<b>There's no such bond between you and me.</b>

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:07.620
<b>But please,</b>

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:08.910
<b>lend me your strength!</b>

00:21:15.420 --> 00:21:16.700
<b>Such a two-timer.</b>

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:20.710
<b>That settles it.</b>

00:21:40.110 --> 00:21:41.830
<b>Charge!</b>

00:21:42.820 --> 00:21:44.510
<b>Stick with Eleonora!</b>

00:21:44.510 --> 00:21:45.740
<b>Don't fall behind!</b>

00:21:52.330 --> 00:21:53.750
<b>They've broken through the gate?!</b>

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:56.000
<b>Eleonora!</b>

00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:05.510
<b>Thus the nocturnal battle at Tatra begins.</b>

00:22:05.510 --> 00:22:09.010
<b>Soon fellow war maidens will cross blades with one another.</b>

